WEBVTT

22:00.596 --> 22:03.765
at the Last Hearth.
Blue of eye, brown of hair

22:03.891 --> 22:07.311
and fair complected,
died in his 14th year

22:07.436 --> 22:09.605
of a wound sustained in a bear hunt.

22:09.730 --> 22:13.400
As I said, my lord,
a ponderous read.

22:13.525 --> 22:16.111
Did Jon Arryn tell you
what he wanted with it?

22:16.236 --> 22:19.072
He did not, my lord.
And I did not presume to ask.

22:19.197 --> 22:21.366
- Jon's death...
- Such a tragedy.

22:21.491 --> 22:23.869
...did he say anything to you
during his final hours?

22:23.994 --> 22:25.871
Nothing of import, my lord.

22:25.996 --> 22:30.667
Oh. There was one phrase
he kept repeating.
